WEBVTT

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:46.380
Good Morning!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.340
Good Morning.

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:50.320
Good Morning!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.020
'Morning.

00:01:58.130 --> 00:01:59.480
What's with him?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.410
Maybe he's excited 'cause of the new semester.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.590
A new semester...

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.480
I guess that means summer's over.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.400
I wonder if something happened...

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:11.660
What a moron.

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:14.580
She wouldn't just sigh like that over nothing.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.470
Have fun again today!

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:18.920
Okay!

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:32.580
Mornin'!

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:39.780
What?

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:42.650
Kokoro-chan! Morning!

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:43.930
Long time no see!

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.890
Your bangs have grown, huh?

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:48.970
Kokoro-chin?

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:54.990
Kippei, you didn't call Kokoro even once all summer!

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:58.960
Don't just go "ha!"

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.050
The worst of the worst!

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:02.560
Go to hell!

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:04.480
You don't love her enough!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:05.970
Break up!

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:07.520
That's...

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:17.380
I'm trying to tell you she's pissed!

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:21.170
How can you just come in saying, "long time no see", with no shame?

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.580
Ko- Kokoro-chin...

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.370
Scary!

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:32.590
The welcoming ceremony is about to start.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:43.150
I think you understand, but... Kokoro is popular!

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.180
What'd you mean by that?

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.350
There's not much to it...

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:52.680
If you leave her alone for too long, she'll get a new man.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:55.760
Kokoro-chan wouldn't do that!

00:03:56.370 --> 00:04:00.790
To think she wouldn't do something like that is just feeding your manly ego.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.320
Is that true?

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.690
Totally.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.100
What'd you do during summer?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.360
I worked the whole time.

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.120
Kokoro-chan!

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.300
I'm really sorry!

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:27.230
I feel like that's all I'll ever hear you say.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.240
And... I am sorry...

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.990
This is hard to say during something like this...

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.520
I need to go get Yuzuyu-chan.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:49.530
Go.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:53.170
Your eyes are telling me not to go.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:54.600
No, they are not.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.410
Kokoro-chan, c'mere for a sec.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:26.320
I'll be going.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.260
I'll see ya tomorrow.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.640
Let's eat lunch together!

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.950
Don't think you're forgiven just yet.

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:43.300
I'm being too mean.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:49.170
You won't go shopping with use!?

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:50.320
Why not?

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.000
I don't feel like it.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:53.960
I'm gonna turn in my homework and go home.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:55.320
Sorry.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:56.600
Homework?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.370
You're going shopping, even though you haven't done your homework, Aki?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.580
Do your homework.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.000
Who're you?

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:45.920
I thought it was beautiful...

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:48.630
Thanks.

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:50.680
You're in the art club?

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:51.700
Yes.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.500
Do you like paintings?

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.000
I like looking at them...

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.800
You're Tokunaga-san, right?

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:13.380
During our freshman year, we were both member of the committee for the cultural festival.

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:15.100
Is that so?

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:16.670
You don't remember...

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:17.540
Nope.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:21.130
It's probably because I didn't attend much.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:22.100
I see.

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:23.530
Well, see ya.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:27.460
See ya.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:36.860
Tokunaga-san!

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:37.860
Umm...

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:47.870
Will you be my model?

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:49.060
Model?

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:55.780
I was thinking you're the perfect image for what I've been wanting to paint.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.620
You... won't?

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:02.020
It's not that...

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:04.250
Then...

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.200
Let me think about it for a bit...

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:08.450
Okay.

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:10.300
A picture model?

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:12.590
The perfect image?

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:15.530
That's the start of love!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.450
What'll Kippei do?

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.680
A rival's appeared.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:24.600
Ice Cream!

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:25.420
Okay!

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.900
Go put your bag away and get changed.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:29.540
Okay!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.290
What, you bought ice cream?

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:35.460
What about me?

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:37.130
What're you talking about?

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:38.660
Go buy your own.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.030
Stingy.

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:43.360
Ice Cream!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:44.160
Okay!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:46.810
Yay!

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:54.750
What's wrong, Reiko?

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:58.280
Kippei! Kippei! Kippei! Kippei!!!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.860
Come here!!

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:03.390
Okay, I'll come.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.350
What is it?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.210
He came out!

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:08.550
Who?

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:10.690
You mean a cockroach?

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:14.520
You're calling me for that? How annoying.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.580
That's not it!

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.000
This can't be happening!

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:25.600
Shut Up!

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:27.870
Where'd he go?

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.010
Don't lose him, you idiot!

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:32.880
Fool! Blockhead!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.050
Hey!

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:36.240
Just calm down.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.300
What? What?

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:42.640
He ran away 'cause of your yelling, Sis!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.870
No!! I'm gonna move!

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:48.230
What's a cockroach?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.060
What's wrong?

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.590
There he is!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:04.950
Get 'im, Kippei!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.220
Sis, can't you be quiet?!

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:16.790
He stopped?

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:23.090
He stopped.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:24.500
Really?

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.390
Just look.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:27.410
No.

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:30.720
Scary!

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:32.660
There, there...

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:34.000
It's okay now!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:37.050
I told you it stopped moving.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:44.350
Serves you right!

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:45.910
You devil!

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:50.130
You might yet be alive if it weren't my house.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:54.390
This is your punishment for having the balls to crawl into the Katakura house!

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.520
Tell your comrades!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.680
Never come here again!

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:00.870
Okay Okay.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:04.930
Why're girls scared of this sorta thing?

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.230
It's not cute at all...

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:08.480
What're you doing?

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:35.310
Miki-chan!

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.500
Your sister's voice is amazing... I heard it all the way outside.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:40.710
Well...

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:42.410
It was Mr. Cockroach.

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.300
Is she noisy like that every time?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:46.970
What a pain...

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:48.330
Don't you get tired?

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:57.220
What?

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.800
What...? You've run away?

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:02.040
Are you stupid?

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:04.570
I came to get my bags.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.950
Ah, your bags.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:08.540
Don't worry.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:09.600
I'll leave soon.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:25.040
Miki-chan, you haven't forgotten anything, right?

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:25.990
Yep.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:28.590
Well then, I'll take you to the station.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.180
Be careful.

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.000
It's hot...

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.910
But... summer's over now.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:49.910
It was so short.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:56.420
Umm... Miki-chan...

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:58.680
Nothing's changed,right?

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.670
How're things with your parents?

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:07.020
I suppose my personality won't go back to normal that easily...

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.570
But it's okay. I was originally a good girl, after all.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:14.770
What?

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:16.670
You have a problem with that?

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:20.280
Don't you think being about to cry is cute?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:21.680
What was that?

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:24.770
With my parents...

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.260
We eat together...

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:35.360
...watch TV...

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:38.020
...go shopping together...

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:40.300
...and go on walks...

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:43.940
They're just normal things...

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:46.540
Though I guess it's still kinda awkward.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.010
You seem happy.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.140
You've noticed?

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:58.180
But... they think I should get some counseling...

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:00.920
It's fine, but they worry to much.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.050
You sure seem happy... that they're worried about you.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:10.800
I'm happy.

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:33.300
Kippei-onii-chan...

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:34.330
What is it?

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:35.430
Is something wrong?

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.010
I... gotta use the bathroom

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:39.080
What?

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.620
Can't you make it to the station?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:44.930
Okay...

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:46.780
Wait a second.

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:49.430
Miki!

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:53.860
I'm gonna take Yuzuyu to the bathroom, so... wait here a bit.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:55.900
Okay.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:57.110
Okay!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:58.920
Let's hurry!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:34.740
Tokunaga-san!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.650
Do you walk around here often?

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:39.050
Yeah, occasionally.

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:40.090
I see.

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:43.960
I just felt like taking this road today...

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:45.720
What a coincidence.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:46.610
I guess.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.920
Umm... Tokunaga-san!

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:06.010
What is it?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.230
Umm...

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:09.450
Your answer from earlier?

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.190
Sorry, I decline.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:21.320
It's not my style.

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:22.430
I see.

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:24.050
See ya.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:32.940
The truth is that I like you!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:40.260
That's what I've been thinking all along, but... I couldn't say it.

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:47.790
Do you have someone you like?

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:50.420
Katakura Kippei.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.330
Kippei...

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:59.180
Sorry that I can't respond to your feelings.

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:01.360
It's okay.

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:03.550
See ya.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:21.680
Hey!

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:25.460
You dropped this.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:29.810
Thanks.

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.280
This was caught on you.

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:42.630
Thanks.

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:56.240
Where'd you go?

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.350
It was nothing.

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.540
"Nothing"? We were worried!

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.000
Is this far enough?

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:05.830
Yep.

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:11.070
Your stuff's heavy.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:14.850
I'm fine... There're escalators, too.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:16.590
See ya.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:17.620
Sure.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:18.980
Be careful.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:23.110
It was fun.

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:24.780
Really?

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:31.580
Yuzuyu...

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:32.390
yeah?

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.330
Sorry about everything.

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:36.750
No... It's okay.

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:38.550
Let's play again.

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:39.520
Okay.

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:45.400
I... love you!

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:48.180
Me, too!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:20.060
Hey... What was tomorrow's homework?

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.370
Math.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.980
I don't understand it, though...

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.610
I couldn't keep up with everyone else...

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:35.490
Though it wasn't on purpose, it seems I caused problems for everyone.

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:41.110
But when I wanted to say something, I just couldn't keep quiet.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:45.430
If I have a future, I want to fly there as soon as possible.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:52.220
If I have a future... If there's a place for me there...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.560
But...

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.360
Thanks.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.310
But... I can't realize that.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.160
Those few honest words..

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:12.930
It was fun.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:16.810
Me, too!

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:20.720
With just those, I'm able to be happy.

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:24.630
My heart warms up.. because this world exists.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.390
Thank you, everyone!

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:39.410
A swallow!

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:45.140
That's the one, Yuzu!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.120
The one Miki-chan's riding?

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:49.330
Yep! She would be riding it!

00:20:51.780 --> 00:21:06.450
Miki-chan!

00:23:07.060 --> 00:23:08.380
Kippei!

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:10.200
What?

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:14.030
Yuzuyu-chan, eat this and wait a bit.

00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:15.710
He's finally come.

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.260
What is it?

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:19.860
Some guy from the art club is after Kokoro.

00:23:20.260 --> 00:23:21.200
Really?

00:23:21.780 --> 00:23:23.340
Kippei's in a pinch!

00:23:24.560 --> 00:23:25.250
and so?

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:26.620
What do you mean, "and so"?

00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:28.710
What'd Kokoro-chin say?

00:23:29.550 --> 00:23:30.340
Dunno.

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:31.750
"Dunno"?

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:34.570
We dunno what she said.

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.410
I wonder what happened.

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:38.890
She might have wandered off with him by now.

00:23:39.170 --> 00:23:40.160
"Wandered off?"

00:23:40.460 --> 00:23:41.390
From what?

00:23:41.880 --> 00:23:42.970
I dunno.

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:45.500
Well, let's go.

00:23:46.180 --> 00:23:46.660
Okay!

00:23:48.330 --> 00:23:50.100
Yuzuyu-chan, bye bye!

00:23:50.680 --> 00:23:52.910
Okay Bye bye!

00:23:53.790 --> 00:23:54.570
Really?

00:23:59.210 --> 00:24:00.730
It's good medicine every once in a while.

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:04.790
The truth is Kokoro thinks only of him.

00:24:05.580 --> 00:24:07.290
We'll absolutely not tell him.

00:24:20.260 --> 00:24:21.140
I'm gonna go!

00:24:21.440 --> 00:24:23.370
Kippei-onii-chan has a cold?

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:24.540
Go back to sleep!

00:24:24.790 --> 00:24:26.070
Let's go,Yuzuyu-chan!

00:24:26.200 --> 00:24:26.850
Okay!

00:24:27.090 --> 00:24:28.150
Let's hold hands.

00:24:29.090 --> 00:24:30.590
What about the flying dash?

00:24:31.710 --> 00:24:32.780
Let's play in the sand!

00:24:33.940 --> 00:24:34.830
Are you tired?

00:24:35.350 --> 00:24:36.160
Not really.

00:24:36.950 --> 00:24:38.640
Next time on Aishiteru ze Baby:

00:24:39.230 --> 00:24:40.510
If I Grew Up...

00:24:41.080 --> 00:24:42.890
Ayumi-chan you're sure cute!

00:24:44.230 --> 00:24:45.040
Not really..

00:24:45.190 --> 00:24:46.560
Yuzuyu!!
